DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270325
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270326
SUMMARY:Annunciation
LOCATION:Tinos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Second great Marian feast at the Church of Panagia. Smaller than August but still significant — and this is when the icon was discovered in 1823.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/tinos/#annunciation
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/tinos/#annunciation
END:VEVENT
